      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说是为了缓解比赛带来的疲劳，\r\n但训练变轻松了又感觉有些不够呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "521b0e4fe5625c0f8883c6b5a9263f72f69fed4760bda5068f912bf3f620674a",
